		{"id":"legend","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":460,"height":289,"color":"5","text":"### Legend\n\nCyan: curriculum hierarchy (module guide to lesson).\nBlue: lesson to atomic topic.\nGreen: topic grounds in a source record (each green edge reads \"grounded by\").\nOrange: uncertainty and limits.\nPurple: hypotheses and open questions.\n\nAn edge records a relationship in this library; it is never a causal claim."},
