		{"id":"uncertainty","type":"text","x":0,"y":609,"width":460,"height":154,"color":"2","text":"### Uncertainty\n\n- Complex trauma exposure is not a diagnosis\n- The phase comparison is of packages\n- PTSD biology is not complex PTSD biology"},
		{"id":"hypothesis","type":"text","x":0,"y":823,"width":460,"height":256,"color":"6","text":"### Open questions\n\n- How distinct are the self-organization domains in practice, and how should instruments handle overlap?\n- How should instruments be harmonised across ICD-11 and DSM-5 for pooled analyses?\n- Which baseline characteristics predict benefit for which trauma interventions?"},
